<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλότομ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cutting</i> or <i>felling wood,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελέκεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.114
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Wi.</u>
					13.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλοτόμος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>woodcutter, woodman,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.123
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				807
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				98
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.1084.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				17(2).229
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑλότομον</span> either <i>a plant
				cut in the wood</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέμνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			), used as a charm; or =
			<i>worm</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερέοικος</span>),
			supposed to be the cause of pain in teething (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐλοτόμοιο</span> may be the right reading), <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				229
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
